      <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting on this page.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6">6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>Causewave Innovations LLP<br>Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India<br>Email: <a href="mailto:innovate@causewave.in" class="text-sky-600 hover:underline">innovate@causewave.in</a><br>Phone: +91 76005 96053</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>